        "TileImage": "$($repository 3c75f6d8-5b88-4bb9-913a-13eb854a68b2).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning 47. Our client, Don Yates, has hired us to eliminate old clients who have recently sought to end his career, by going to the news and revealing all of Don&apos;s scandalous secrets. He was able to stop them for now, by inviting them to his party, but he does not know how long their silence will last. He prefers we do this quietly, so we cannot be seen. All targets must die in accidents or to poison, so that no one is alerted to our prescense, and Don is not tied to any of the murders.",
